      "text": "preprocess_attacks_ml()\n\nPROTOCOL: TCP->6 UDP->17 ICMP->1\nFill nulls con mediana\nCap outliers p99.9\nDtype map (int8, float64)\n\n14 NUMERIC_FEATURES\nTarget: IS_ATTACK",
