      "text": "train_baseline_model()\n\nTrain/Test 80/20 stratified\nStandardScaler (fit train)\n\nRandomForestClassifier(\n  n_estimators=50\n  max_depth=12\n  min_samples_leaf=20\n  n_jobs=2\n)\n\n~14 segundos",
